                                "sense_id": "47a218e0-8753-303a-a37b-fd5999d59d01",
                                "text": "Then on the verdrous Bank, where Spices rose, Rowl on the balmy Grass, or smiling play With her young Cade, her caded Lamb with Smiles Answer'd her Love, and lickt her dainty hand."
